{"id":"n88091-1-7","stage":4,"title":"후손 · 后裔","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88091-1-7-1","ko":"지수는 유명한 화가의 후손이잖아.","zh":"智秀可是那位著名画家的后代啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지수는","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"지수는","audio":"/audio/9ca6ce32d0646be4023e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"유명한","meaning":"有名，知名，著名","explanation":"유명하다：有名，知名，著名；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"유명하다","audio":"/audio/cad171780a04b71eb7bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29716","senseId":"1","lemma":"유명하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화가의","meaning":"画家","explanation":"화가：画家；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"화가","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73228","senseId":"1","lemma":"화가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"후손이잖아.","meaning":"后裔，后嗣，后孙，子孙，子孙后代","explanation":"후손：后裔，后嗣，后孙，子孙，子孙后代；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；잖아：提醒对方已知的事实，非敬语：“不是……嘛”。","readings":[{"term":"후손","audio":"/audio/f87677976e471273a140.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88091","senseId":"1","lemma":"후손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"cad171780a04b71e","term":"유명하다","zh":"有名，知名，著名","audio":"/audio/cad171780a04b71eb7bf.mp3","entryId":"29716","definition":"名字广为人知。","pronunciation":["유ː명하다"]},{"id":"b04487b70213c84b","term":"화가","zh":"画家","audio":"/audio/b04487b70213c84b3d2d.mp3","entryId":"73228","definition":"专业画画的人。","pronunciation":["화ː가"]},{"id":"f87677976e471273","term":"후손","zh":"后裔，后嗣，后孙，子孙，子孙后代","audio":"/audio/f87677976e471273a140.mp3","entryId":"88091","definition":"从自己的一代开始许多代之后的子女。","pronunciation":["후ː손"]}],"audio":"/audio/274fc0faee1a2a8dccaa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88091-1-7-2","ko":"아, 그래서 지수가 그림을 잘 그리는구나.","zh":"啊，原来如此，所以智秀的画才画得那么好啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"哦","explanation":"아：哦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"4","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그래서","meaning":"因此，所以","explanation":"그래서：因此，所以","readings":[{"term":"그래서","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61169","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래서","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"그림을","meaning":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","explanation":"그림：画儿，绘画，画作，图画；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"그림","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29687","senseId":"1","lemma":"그림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그리는구나.","meaning":"画","explanation":"그리다：画；는구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"그리다","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57277","senseId":"1","lemma":"그리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"哦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"由不知道而转向醒悟时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"8df56b9bfbdae2fd","term":"그래서","zh":"因此，所以","audio":"/audio/8df56b9bfbdae2fd8463.mp3","entryId":"61169","definition":"用于表示前面内容是后面内容的原因、依据或条件等。","pronunciation":["그래서"]},{"id":"c143fe9e8e3a2db7","term":"그림","zh":"画儿，绘画，画作，图画","audio":"/audio/c143fe9e8e3a2db7a2c3.mp3","entryId":"29687","definition":"用线条或色彩把事物的模样或形象等表现在平面上的东西。","pronunciation":["그ː림"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"729cbc127a38cc4c","term":"그리다","zh":"画","audio":"/audio/729cbc127a38cc4c4f21.mp3","entryId":"57277","definition":"利用铅笔或毛笔等以线条或色彩来表现事物。","pronunciation":["그ː리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/17615196d43c46dcaa97.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.143,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88091","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":149,"sequenceScore":2.9697,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，原来如此，所以智秀的画才画得那么好啊。","现在能看到山顶了吗？","智秀可是那位著名画家的后代啊。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["啊，原来如此，所以智秀的画才画得那么好啊。","智秀可是那位著名画家的后代啊。","现在能看到山顶了吗？"],"answer":0}]}
